
This directory contains ten sample commands as examples of reloading programs
with libra.a.  They are cat, chmod, cp, diff, ln, ls, mkdir, mv, rm and rmdir.
There are lots more commands/utilities reloaded with libra.a, and you will
develop your own application programs by using libra.a.

Those source codes which are unchanged are not listed in this directory.  Users
should make symbolic links to their source files (in /usr/src/bin, for example)
before running the Makefile.

See also the manual page cmds(1R).

